https://github.com/iOfficeAI/AionUi
Xylo uses its own name and does not include AionUi brand artwork.

Xylo bundles Obscura v0.2.6, built from source at immutable revision
8534b401898ed17b62f69bdc3d5eb186bffb0d60:
https://github.com/h4ckf0r0day/obscura
Obscura is licensed under Apache License 2.0. Xylo builds the standard
render-enabled CLI (no stealth feature) as xylo-obscura, its sole native
managed-browser runtime. The bundled licenses/obscura resource contains the
upstream license, available upstream/vendor and Cargo dependency notices,
and BUILD.json recording the pinned source and dependency attribution.
Source and build dependencies are fetched only during the build; installed
Xylo does not download a browser runtime. Obscura's independent web engine
is not Chromium and does not promise full browser/web-platform compatibility.

Other third-party dependencies retain their respective copyright and license
notices. Cargo.lock identifies the Rust dependency versions used by this build.
The managed OS sandbox helper uses @anthropic-ai/sandbox-runtime 0.0.81;
its dependency versions and integrity hashes are pinned in
crates/services/sandbox-helper/package-lock.json. Distributed helper resources
include each dependency's original license and notice files.
Native asset distributors must also include the notices for every supplied
browser, inference binary, document library, speech engine and model weight.

